				4
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Update submodules with LSP provider types and bug fixes\n\nCoordinate submodule updates across the Land ecosystem:\n\nCommon: Add EvaluatableExpression and InlineValues LSP provider types (values 26-27) to extend language server support for evaluatable expressions and inline values.\n\nMaintain: Add mountain emoji (🏞️) to Land Ecosystem section header for visual consistency.\n\nMountain: Fix type mismatches and API changes in WindServiceHandlers including Storage, QuickInput, Workspaces, Themes, and Search handlers to match updated Common library contracts.\n\nWind: Synchronize with updated Common types and Mountain API changes.",
